  "question": {
    "text": "A book of weight <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math> is pressed between two hands and each hand exerts a force of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>40</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>. If the book just starts to slide down. What is the value of the coefficient of friction?"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "0.25",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0116_999b72d6509b.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 152px;\" /><br /><br />Block is in horizontal equilibrium. In the vertical direction, it is in limiting equilibrium.<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>&#956;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>40</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><msub><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>F</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>F</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>20</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn></math>"
  }
